      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$D = (x + 3)^2 - (x - 3)^2$",
          "$D = x^2 + 2 \\times x \\times 3 + 3^2 - \\left[x^2 - 2 \\times x \\times 3 + 3^2\\right]$",
          "$D = x^2 + 6x + 9 - (x^2 - 6x + 9)$",
          "$D = x^2 + 6x + 9 - x^2 + 6x - 9$"
        ],
        "result": "D = 12x"
